  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_dart_SurrenderRatioMember" xml:lang="ko">"비일시납 납입중은 보유계약 연납화보험료 대비 해지/실효계약의 연납화보험료 비율, 그 외의 납입구분에서는 보유계약 건수 대비 해지/실효계약의 건수 비율. 채널별, 일시납 여부, 납입여부, 상품군별(저해지 상품구분), 고/저금리의 산출단위로 경과기간 별 산출 (2020.07월 ~2025.06월 당사 경험통계 사용)"</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_dart_LossRatioMember" xml:lang="ko">"최신위험보험료 대비 지급보험금 비율. 담보별(사망,장해,암진단/치료,입통원,수술 등)경과기간, 연령별 산출 (2020.07월 ~2025.06월 당사 경험통계 사용) 실손의료보험은 연령 미구분 적용함을 명시한 실무표준 개정사항 반영"</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_dart_OperatingExpenseRateMember" xml:lang="ko">"수당수수료 등 : 영업채널별 수당수수료 지급규정(영업제도)에 따른 성적, 지급기간 등을 반영 및 산출(영업성과 연동 판매촉진비 포함) 일반사업비 : 보험취득현금흐름(보험료 비례), 보험취득현금흐름(기타), 유지비, 손해조사비, 투자관리비에 대해 채널별 상품군별로 계약건수, 보험료 등의 원가동인별로 산출. K-IFRS1117(보험계약)에 따른 간접비는 대상에서 제외 (2024.07월 ~ 2025.06월 당사 경험통계 사용) "</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_ifrs-full_DiscountRateMeasurementInputMember" xml:lang="ko">"금융감독원 'IFRS17 보험부채 할인율 개선방안' 적용한 결정론적 할인율 기준 1000개 시나리오의 평균  (2026년 03월 기준 결정론적 할인율  3.0732%  ~ 4.3%)"</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_dart_ConfidenceLevelUsedToDetermineRiskAdjustmentForNonfinancialRiskMember" xml:lang="ko">보험업감독업무시행세칙 [별표35] 책임준비금 산출기준에 따라 75 퍼센타일 충격수준 적용</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods>
  <entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_dart_SurrenderRatioMember" xml:lang="ko">"보험업감독업무시행세칙 [별표35] 책임준비금 산출기준 제10장 가정의 산출방법 10-3. (해약률)  금융감독원 계리적 가정 산출 및 적용에 관한 실무표준 (2026.03)"</entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems>
  <entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_dart_LossRatioMember" xml:lang="ko">"보험업감독업무시행세칙 [별표35] 책임준비금 산출기준 제10장 가정의 산출방법 10-4. (위험률)  금융감독원 계리적 가정 산출 및 적용에 관한 실무표준 (2026.03)"</entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems>
  <entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_dart_OperatingExpenseRateMember" xml:lang="ko">"보험업감독업무시행세칙 [별표35] 책임준비금 산출기준 제10장 가정의 산출방법 10-2. (사업비율)"</entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems>
  <entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_ifrs-full_DiscountRateMeasurementInputMember" xml:lang="ko">"보험업감독업무시행세칙 [별표35] 책임준비금 산출기준 제9장 할인율 가정"</entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems>
  <entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_dart_ConfidenceLevelUsedToDetermineRiskAdjustmentForNonfinancialRiskMember" xml:lang="ko">"보험업감독업무시행세칙 [별표35] 책임준비금 산출기준 제 5장 위험조정 및 수익 인식기준 5-1. (생명보험 및 장기손해보험 위험조정의 산출) 5-1.나. 준용"</entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods contextRef="PFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_dart_SurrenderRatioMember" xml:lang="ko">"비일시납 납입중은 보유계약 연납화보험료 대비 해지/실효계약의 연납화보험료 비율, 그 외의 납입구분에서는 보유계약 건수 대비 해지/실효계약의 건수 비율. 채널별, 일시납 여부, 납입여부, 상품군별(저해지 상품구분), 고/저금리의 산출단위로 경과기간 별 산출 (2020.07월 ~2025.06월 당사 경험통계 사용)"</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods contextRef="PFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_dart_LossRatioMember" xml:lang="ko">"최신위험보험료 대비 지급보험금 비율. 담보별(사망,장해,암진단/치료,입통원,수술 등)경과기간, 연령별 산출 (2020.07월 ~2025.06월 당사 경험통계 사용)"</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods contextRef="PFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_dart_OperatingExpenseRateMember" xml:lang="ko">"수당수수료 등 : 영업채널별 수당수수료 지급규정(영업제도)에 따른 성적, 지급기간 등을 반영 및 산출(영업성과 연동 판매촉진비 포함) 일반사업비 : 보험취득현금흐름(보험료 비례), 보험취득현금흐름(기타), 유지비, 손해조사비, 투자관리비에 대해 채널별 상품군별로 계약건수, 보험료 등의 원가동인별로 산출. K-IFRS1117(보험계약)에 따른 간접비는 대상에서 제외 (2024.07월 ~ 2025.06월 당사 경험통계 사용) "</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods contextRef="PFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_ifrs-full_DiscountRateMeasurementInputMember" xml:lang="ko">"금융감독원 'IFRS17 보험부채 할인율 개선방안' 적용한 결정론적 할인율 기준 1000개 시나리오의 평균  (2025년 12월 기준 결정론적 할인율  2.7941%  ~ 4.3%)"</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods contextRef="PFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_dart_ConfidenceLevelUsedToDetermineRiskAdjustmentForNonfinancialRiskMember" xml:lang="ko">보험업감독업무시행세칙 [별표35] 책임준비금 산출기준에 따라 75 퍼센타일 충격수준 적용</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17AndProcessesForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethods>
  <entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_InputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17Axis_dart_SurrenderRatioMember" xml:lang="ko">"보험업감독업무시행세칙 [별표35] 책임준비금 산출기준 제10장 가정의 산출방법 10-3. (해약률)  금융감독원 계리적 가정 산출 및 적용에 관한 실무표준 (2025.02)"</entity00112332:DescriptionOfMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17AndBasisForEstimatingInputsToThoseMethodsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIfrs17LineItemsOfDisclosureOfInputsToMethodsUsedToMeasureContractsWithinScopeOfIFRS17TableOfItems>
